  "statement": "import Mathlib\n\n/-\nFor the imaginary unit $i$, where $i^2 = -1$, the following equality holds:\n\n    $i^{73} = i$\n-/\n\nopen Complex\n\naxiom i_pow_73 : I ^ 73 = I\n\n\ntheorem i_pow_mod_4 (n : ℕ) : I ^ n = I ^ (n % 4) := by\n  sorry",
